    "code": "\"\"\"Read archived payloads encrypted with three-key Triple-DES in CBC mode (PKCS7 padding, 8-byte IV prepended).\"\"\"\n\nfrom legacy_cipher import decrypt_payload\n\n\ndef read_archived_payload(key: bytes, blob: bytes) -> bytes:\n    \"\"\"\n    Decrypt a legacy archived payload encrypted with three-key Triple-DES CBC with PKCS7 padding.\n    This is allowed only for legacy data as per NIST guidance.\n    :param key: 24-byte three-key TDEA key\n    :param blob: IV (8 bytes) || ciphertext\n    :return: plaintext bytes\n    \"\"\"\n    return decrypt_payload(key, blob)\n",
